use firn/tags

promptfoo is a Module
promptfoo is tagged development

nix module
  arguments: config, lib, pkgs, ...
  config when config.myConfig.modules.promptfoo.enable
    "environment"
      "systemPackages": [pkgs.promptfoo]
  option "myConfig"."modules"."promptfoo"."enable": enable "promptfoo — local, MIT-licensed LLM eval runner (no lock-in)"
